---
// Privacy (plan §5.1). Describes only what this build actually ships: the analytics paragraph
// appears only when the beacon is built in, the Turnstile paragraph only when the widget is.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { VIDEOS } from '../lib/releases.ts';
const videos = Object.keys(VIDEOS).length > 0;
const analytics = !!import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN;
const turnstile = !!import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY;
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What theluxuryliners.com collects (very little) and why.">
  <PageHead title="Privacy" size="l">
    <p class="lede">What this site collects (very little) and why.</p>
  </PageHead>
  <div class="wrap page-body">
  <div class="prose">
    {turnstile
      ? <p>This site sets no cookies and has no accounts. Its pages keep nothing in your browser unless you choose a theme (see below). The other exception is the spam check on the contact page, which is run by Cloudflare and may keep a little data in your browser while it works.</p>
      : <p>This site sets no cookies and has no accounts. Its pages keep nothing in your browser unless you choose a theme (see below).</p>}
    <h2>Light and dark themes</h2>
    <p>If you use the “Dark theme” switch, your browser remembers your choice (in its local storage) so the next page opens the same way. It stays on your device and is never sent to us. Clearing your browser’s site data removes it.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site is served by Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare handles your IP address and browser details to deliver pages and to protect the site from abuse.</p>
    {analytics && (
      <>
        <h2>Visitor counts</h2>
        <p>We count visits with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which uses no cookies and does not follow you from site to site. It tells us which pages are read, not who reads them.</p>
      </>
    )}
    <h2>The contact form</h2>
    <p>When you send a message, the name, email address, topic and message you enter are emailed to the band so we can reply. The site does not keep a copy. To stop the form being used for spam, the number of messages sent from one connection is limited for a short time.</p>
    {turnstile && <p>The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to check that a person, not a program, is sending it. Turnstile is loaded only on the contact page, and it may store a small amount of data in your browser to run its check. It is covered by Cloudflare’s own privacy policy.</p>}
    {videos && (
      <>
        <h2>Videos</h2>
        <p>Some pages have a video from YouTube. Nothing is loaded from YouTube until you press play. When you do, the video plays from youtube-nocookie.com, YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode, and Google’s privacy policy applies to it.</p>
      </>
    )}
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Links to Spotify, Apple Music, Bandcamp, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and other sites take you to those services, which have their own privacy policies. Nothing from them is loaded on this site’s pages until you choose to follow a link or play a video.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
